  newsItems:
  - id: 28
    title: THANK YOU
    content: A sincere thank you to everyone who purchased any of the MIGHTY modules,
      or even just the core MAPS asset.  Expect amazing things to come.  If you're
      enjoying please, I would love a nice review.  If there's issues please log
      a bug report or email me directly.  You'll find links for all this within the
      settings menu for each asset!  Good luck with your project!!
    date_posted: 2025-06-20T05:09:09.699974
    url: 
    expired: 0
    isRead: 0
    archived: 0
